      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "All joint tissues are affected by the pathological process which leads to osteoarthritis: cartilage, subchrondal bone and synovial membrane. The speed at which osteoarthritis symptoms develop depends on the patient. There is currently no way of knowing how the disease will develop in a patient."},
